stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle: Component Mount

    Idle --> Loading: Subscribe to feed
    Loading --> Success: Events loaded
    Loading --> Error: Subscription failed

    Success --> Updating: New event received
    Updating --> Success: Event added

    Success --> Paginating: User scrolls down
    Paginating --> Success: Older events loaded
    Paginating --> Error: Fetch failed

    Success --> Filtering: User changes filters
    Filtering --> Loading: Re-subscribe

    Success --> Publishing: User likes/reposts
    Publishing --> Success: Optimistic update
    Publishing --> Error: Publish failed

    Error --> Loading: Retry
    Error --> Idle: Clear error

    Success --> [*]: Component unmount
